    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3042" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ăpŏchă</span></b> ,
		ae, f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποχή</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>the receipt of a creditor acknowledging the payment of a
			debt</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">apocha non alias contingit quam si pecunia
					soluta sit,</span>”
				<i>there is no receipt till the money is paid</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Dig.
					46, 4, 19</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">47, 2, 27</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">12, 6, 67,
				§ 3</span></i>.</div>
